# Reproducible Git checkouts for all application/build/test sources.
# Windows launchers are committed with their exact CRLF bytes.
# Do NOT apply text/eol conversion to .cmd: existing Git blobs already have
# CRLF; rewriting them via a clean filter makes checkout look permanently dirty.
*.js text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.cmd -text
*.ico binary
